<simplesect kind="return"><para>0 Returned on successfully deriving a key from the input password </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>BAD_FUNC_ARG Returned if there is an invalid hash type given (valid type are: MD5 and SHA), iterations is less than 1, or the key length (kLen) requested is greater than the hash length of the provided hash </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>MEMORY_E Returned if there is an error allocating memory for a SHA or MD5 object</para>
</simplesect>
